WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Driving electronic beat] A train travels across the valley at an angle. Carriages cross the signal in time.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Overhead poles and platform lights sweep past. Road traffic and the more distant depot travel at different speeds.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Carriages keep crossing to the beat, with the nearest trackside objects moving fastest.
